<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>From soul and self turn away,</l><l>Look unto Jesus today;</l><l>There is no time to delay—</l><l>Jesus is coming again!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Foolish ones never will turn;</l><l>When the Lord comes they will learn</l><l>There is no oil left to burn—</l><l>Jesus is coming again!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Wise virgins buy up the time;</l><l>Never drunk with the world’s wine,</l><l>Filled in the spirit they shine—</l><l>Jesus is coming again!</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Let us go forth unto Him,</l><l>Not only with our lamps trimmed,</l><l>Buy the oil now lest they dim—</l><l>Jesus is coming again!</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Jesus is now on His way,</l><l>Watch, for you know not the day;</l><l>Ever in His presence stay—</l><l>Jesus is coming again!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
